{"version": 1, "pages": [{"id": "new-project", "title": "Cycle 2 · New project", "shapes": [{"id": "doc-title", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -900, "w": 15840, "h": 240}, "text": "<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest Dashboard — Cycle 2 — New project</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>6 screens, left → right · Desktop 1440 wide · commit 191461b · <a href=\"https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/new.html\">https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/new.html</a> · harvested manually</span></p>"}, {"id": "legend-box", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -600, "w": 2600, "h": 440}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to add anything</b><br>Put a sticky note INSIDE a grey frame and write what you want changed on that screen of the New project flow. Harvests of this project are manual; safe requests are applied, committed and deployed. Start with <b>Do:</b> / <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts. Purple = feedback about this board.<br><b>Stickies show your name — stay signed in.</b></p>"}, {"id": "legend-red", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 2700, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FF8A80"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C62828", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"}, {"id": "legend-yellow", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3020, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FFE066"}, "stroke": {"color": "#9A7B00", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"}, {"id": "legend-blue", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3340, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#A3E4FF"}, "stroke": {"color": "#1565C0", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Blue</b><br>Consider</p>"}, {"id": "legend-purple", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3660, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#BA23F6"}, "stroke": {"color": "#7B1FA2", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "textColor": "#FFFFFF"}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Purple</b><br>Board feedback</p>"}, {"id": "frame-01-home-new-button", "type": "sparkFrame", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 2240, "h": 3425}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#F2F3F5"}, "stroke": {"color": "#F2F3F5", "width": 0, "style": "solid"}}, "title": "01-home-new-button · / · Home — + New project", "customData": [{"key": "stepKey", "value": "01-home-new-button"}, {"key": "route", "value": "/"}, {"key": "cycle", "value": "2"}, {"key": "flow", "value": "New project"}]}, {"id": "shot-01-home-new-button", "type": "image", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 400, "w": 1440, "h": 1024}, "image": {"type": "image", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/captures/harvest-dashboard/c2-new-project/01-home-new-button.png"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C9CED8", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "actions": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/", "newWindow": true}]}, {"id": "caption-01-home-new-button", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 1784, "w": 1440, "h": 260}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>01-home-new-button · Home — + New project</b><br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Starting point: the all-projects home page. The + New project button (outlined in red) opens the setup form.</span><br><span style='font-size:16pt'><b>Clicked: + New project</b></span></p>"}, {"id": "frame-02-new-empty", "type": "sparkFrame", "boundingBox": {"x": 2720, "y": 0, "w": 2240, "h": 3425}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#F2F3F5"}, "stroke": {"color": "#F2F3F5", "width": 0, "style": "solid"}}, "title": "02-new-empty · /new.html · New project form — empty", "customData": [{"key": "stepKey", "value": "02-new-empty"}, {"key": "route", "value": "/new.html"}, {"key": "cycle", "value": "2"}, {"key": "flow", "value": "New project"}]}, {"id": "shot-02-new-empty", "type": "image", "boundingBox": {"x": 3120, "y": 400, "w": 1440, "h": 1770}, "image": {"type": "image", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/captures/harvest-dashboard/c2-new-project/02-new-empty.png"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C9CED8", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "actions": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/new.html", "newWindow": true}]}, {"id": "caption-02-new-empty", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 3120, "y": 2530, "w": 1440, "h": 260}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>02-new-empty · New project form — empty</b><br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Blank setup form: project, prototype source, live site &amp; Netlify, flows to capture, harvest schedule (manual / daily / weekly with day pickers), merge policy, reviewers.</span><br><span style='font-size:16pt'><b>Next: fill in the form</b></span></p>"}, {"id": "frame-03-form-filled", "type": "sparkFrame", "boundingBox": {"x": 5440, "y": 0, "w": 2240, "h": 3425}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#F2F3F5"}, "stroke": {"color": "#F2F3F5", "width": 0, "style": "solid"}}, "title": "03-form-filled · /new.html · Form filled with sample data", "customData": [{"key": "stepKey", "value": "03-form-filled"}, {"key": "route", "value": "/new.html"}, {"key": "cycle", "value": "2"}, {"key": "flow", "value": "New project"}]}, {"id": "shot-03-form-filled", "type": "image", "boundingBox": {"x": 5840, "y": 400, "w": 1440, "h": 2005}, "image": {"type": "image", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/captures/harvest-dashboard/c2-new-project/03-form-filled.png"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C9CED8", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "actions": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/new.html", "newWindow": true}]}, {"id": "caption-03-form-